  "ingredients": [
    "2 ounce cheddar cheese",
    "1/2 medium red bell pepper",
    "30 gram green onion",
    "16 ounce ground chicken",
    "2 tablespoon fresh cilantro (chopped)",
    "1/2 teaspoon garlic powder",
    "1/2 teaspoon crushed red pepper flakes",
    "1/2 teaspoon salt",
    "1/2 medium lime (juiced and zested)",
    "2 tablespoon almond flour",
    "2 tablespoon flaxseed meal",
    "1 medium avocado",
    "1/2 medium lime (juiced)",
    "1/4 teaspoon garlic powder",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 350F. Shred the cheddar cheese into a bowl and set aside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-chili-lime-meatballs/#wprm-recipe-51527-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/01/img_2250.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Finely chop the bell pepper and green onions.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-chili-lime-meatballs/#wprm-recipe-51527-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/01/img_2254.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the ground chicken and vegetables to the bowl the with cheese. Chop the cilantro and add it in. Season with garlic powder, crushed red pepper, and salt.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-chili-lime-meatballs/#wprm-recipe-51527-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/01/img_2257.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the lime juice and zest. I find it most comfortable to use a lemon/lime juicer for this step.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-chili-lime-meatballs/#wprm-recipe-51527-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/01/img_2261.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the almond flour and flaxseed meal and mix everything together well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-chili-lime-meatballs/#wprm-recipe-51527-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/01/img_2263.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Shape the mixture into meatballs, making them as uniform as possible. Bake for 15–18 minutes or until cooked through.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-chili-lime-meatballs/#wprm-recipe-51527-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/01/img_2273.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make the simple guacamole by mashing together the avocado, lime juice, garlic powder, and salt and pepper to taste.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-chili-lime-meatballs/#wprm-recipe-51527-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/01/img_2277.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve the meatballs on top of the simple guac for a delicious meal.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-chili-lime-meatballs/#wprm-recipe-51527-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
